    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">First argument must be a a list of file names.  system.file() function in the examples and vignette is used to reach example files in the package, you shouldn&#39;t use it for your own files. You should make a list of file paths denoting names and location of your files. <div>\r\n<br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Altuna</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
